                <li><strong>Safety Standards and Regulatory Compliance:</strong> Manufacturers must strictly adhere to pressure testing protocols and provide comprehensive Safety Data Sheets (SDS) for all products.</li>
                <li><strong>Environmental Impact and Sustainability:</strong> The industry is rapidly shifting toward low-GWP (Global Warming Potential) propellants like HFOs and more sustainable, recyclable aluminum or tinplate packaging.</li>
                <li><strong>Corrosion Inhibition:</strong> In water-containing <strong>formulations</strong>, protecting the integrity of the can is vital for ensuring a 2-year shelf life and preventing catastrophic failures.</li>
